{
  "$comment": [
    "Head-to-head comparison of Level-1 partition methods on a physically",
    "stressed scenario:",
    "  - simbench_lv_cp_heavy (40 electricity, 40 gas, 39 heat communities under",
    "    label-prop default)",
    "  - line_stress scenario: load×1.8, ampacity×0.5  (binding voltage AND",
    "    thermal constraints, forces gossip and constraint propagation to do real",
    "    work)",
    "  - failure_lambda=1.5, max_failures=4 (multi-failure burst, exercises the",
    "    dynamic re-partition path simultaneously)",
    "  - 30 s sim",
    "Two cells per seed:",
    "  - method=label_propagation (radius-bounded, default)",
    "  - method=modularity        (distributed Louvain Phase 1)",
    "Compare:",
    "  - n_comm per sector (logged at scenario build)",
    "  - modularity_Q       (logged at scenario build)",
    "  - holon_admm_result  (downstream effect on L2 activity)",
    "  - community_repartitioned / community_reassigned",
    "  - PWSF_post"
  ],
  "name": "modularity_eval",
  "out_root": "experiment/_runs/eval",
  "simulation_duration_s": 30.0,
  "task_timeout_s": 1800.0,
  "failure_delay_s_max": 2.0,
  "write_timeseries": false,
  "timestamp_dir": true,
  "defaults": {
    "runs_per_grid": 1,
    "failure_lambda": 1.5,
    "max_failures": 4
  },
  "experiments": [
    {
      "name": "modularity_vs_label_prop",
      "grids": [
        "simbench_lv_cp_heavy"
      ],
      "n_seeds": 2,
      "variants": [
        "scare"
      ],
      "ablations": [
        {
          "community_partition_method": "label_propagation"
        },
        {
          "community_partition_method": "modularity",
          "community_modularity_resolution": 1.0
        }
      ],
      "scenarios": [
        {
          "kind": "line_stress",
          "load_scale": 1.8,
          "ampacity_scale": 0.5,
          "slack_budget_pct": 0.45
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
